OL,3,GNEWSADrought reveals childhood memories
OL,4,Aof lost village
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut now, with the dry conditions over
OL,7,Fthe last few months, it is less than a
OL,8,Fthird full and it means stone from
OL,9,Fcollapsed buildings in the villages can
OL,10,Fclearly be seen on the banks of the
OL,11,Freservoir.
